  "body": "Soaring ceilings, sweeping north-facing sea views and 270sqm of impressive contemporary living. Picture long lunches on the covered balcony, evenings watching the light change across the water and the freedom to wander straight from the bottom of your garden into Pacific Parade Reserve. Elevated on a freehold 809sqm site, this is a home where space, sunshine and the sea come together beautifully.\r\n\r\nA relocation to the North Shore is luring our sellers off the coast, creating an exciting opportunity to secure this exceptional Army Bay lifestyle. Don't let another buyer get there first.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* 270sqm timeless weatherboard home with four bedrooms, two living areas.\r\n* Newly built in 2024\r\n* Open-plan kitchen with spacious butler's scullery. \r\n* North-facing covered balcony with magnificent sea views.\r\n* Upper-level master suite with its own private deck and elevated coastal outlook.\r\n* Beautiful oak hardwood flooring and light, neutral interiors with brushed brass finishes.\r\n* Three heat pumps for year-round comfort.\r\n* Spacious laundry with outdoor access.\r\n* Carpeted garage with EV charging station.\r\n* Fibre internet connection.\r\n* Geotechnical report completed for a potential swimming pool.\r\n* Elevated 809sqm freehold site with direct access to Pacific Parade Reserve.\r\n* Convenient to excellent schools including Wentworth College & Primary\r\n\r\nArmy Bay is perfect for those who love life outdoors. Just 750 metres from the beach and boat ramp, you can spend your mornings on the water, afternoons on the sand and weekends exploring the coastal trails of Shakespear Regional Park. Golf at Whangaparaoa Golf Club, take the ferry from Gulf Harbour Marina to Auckland CBD or enjoy the convenience of Everard Dairy, local takeaways and a playground just around the corner. Add a friendly coastal community and the best of the Whangaparaoa Peninsula within easy reach, and it's easy to see why Army Bay is such a sought-after place to call home.\r\n\r\nSea views, direct reserve access and a seriously enviable lifestyle. You'll want to see this one before someone else does.\r\n\r\nDEADLINE SALE: Closes Wednesday 9th December at 4:00pm (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/VCIZ \r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome",
